  "description": "Centralized application configuration access for WA.Core, built on Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration, exposing strongly-typed settings such as file/form storage paths, upload rules, and cache lifetime. FM_FolderPath now resolves per-application under a shared \"workspaces\" root (see release notes for v2.0.0).",
  "id": "SI.WA.Settings",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-09-21T06:21:50.243Z",
