  "published": "2026-09-21T06:18:27.55Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.0.0 (BREAKING): FM_FolderPath now resolves relative configured values against the app's working directory and appends AppName as a subfolder (e.g. \"workspaces\" -> \"workspaces\\{AppName}\"), instead of returning the configured value verbatim -- point FM_FolderPath at the parent folder that holds one subfolder per application, not at the application's own data folder anymore. AppName is now settable at runtime (falls back to the \"AppName\" appsetting when unset), so it can be assigned during startup instead of only read from config.",
